# OpenMux server filesystem locations.
#
# Relocating the OpenMux directories is done here. Uncomment a line and
# edit the path to override the packaged default; the systemd unit
# (EnvironmentFile=) and the server itself read this file, one KEY=VALUE
# per line. A shell environment variable with the same name always beats
# a value here. openmuxctl reads this file too, so the control socket
# stays reachable after a move. If the file is removed the service still
# starts (the unit line starts with '-').
#
# Locations only - never put secrets in this file (it must stay 0644
# readable).
#
# Packaged defaults (set by the systemd unit):
# Logs (aggregate + ports/):            /var/log/openmux
# Runtime (pidfile, control socket):     /run/openmux
# State (muxcon/ssh/web TLS material):   /var/lib/openmux
#
# Override examples:
#OPENMUX_LOG_DIR=/var/log/openmux
#OPENMUX_RUN_DIR=/run/openmux
#OPENMUX_STATE_DIR=/var/lib/openmux
